  "description": "Plot Twist is a modern and addictive fragrance that blends juicy fruits with creamy sweetness and smooth woody warmth. The scent feels playful yet sophisticated, evolving from bright fruity freshness into a rich gourmand woody dry-down. The opening introduces fruity accords with sparkling citrus nuances, creating a vibrant and uplifting first impression that feels juicy and energetic. The heart develops into creamy gourmand notes and soft florals, adding warmth, sweetness, and a smooth elegant balance to the fragrance. The base settles into vanilla, amber, musk, and woods, leaving a warm, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels cozy, modern, and slightly seductive. Plot Twist is perfect for those who enjoy fruity gourmand fragrances with smooth woody depth and a versatile unisex character.",
